        },
        {
            "hypothesis": "if the pink mushrooms (uuids: 776 and 18573) are the Planet X plants that grow only in the presence of the unusual nutrient, then the candidate nutrient is still ambiguous between thorium and potassium, because soil (uuid: 41671) with thorium high and soil (uuid: 24902) with potassium high are both near these mushrooms.",
