        {
            "hypothesis": "if the unusual nutrient required for plant growth is potassium, then the pink mushrooms (uuids: 776 and 18573) are supported by soil (uuid: 24902), which has potassium high.",
            "status": "pending",
            "step": 18,
            "supporting evidence": "Soil 24902, located adjacent to the pink mushrooms, shows potassium high while all other candidate nutrients in that plot are zero."
